{"data": {"notes": [], "reqs": [{"kind": "contract", "priority": "hard", "requirement_id": "R1", "source": {"type": "task_metadata"}, "status": "active", "text": "Entry point `solve` in language python, within the stated limits.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "hard", "requirement_id": "R2", "source": {"char_end": 375, "char_start": 0, "quote": "The function clamp in clamp.py should limit x to the range [lo, hi] but returns wrong values.\n\nImplement the CORRECT behaviour as `solve(data)`: `data` is a dict with the keys `x`, `lo`, `hi` (the arguments of `clamp(x, lo, hi)`), and solve must return what the corrected `clamp` returns.\n\nCurrent implementation (buggy):\ndef clamp(x, lo, hi):\n    return min(lo, max(x, hi))\n", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "The program is correct on all legal inputs of the statement.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R3", "source": {"char_end": 431, "char_start": 387, "quote": "Input:\n{\"hi\": 10, \"lo\": 0, \"x\": 5}\nOutput:\n5", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 1: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R4", "source": {"char_end": 488, "char_start": 443, "quote": "Input:\n{\"hi\": 10, \"lo\": 0, \"x\": -3}\nOutput:\n0", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 2: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R5", "source": {"char_end": 546, "char_start": 500, "quote": "Input:\n{\"hi\": 10, \"lo\": 0, \"x\": 99}\nOutput:\n10", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 3: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}], "request_sha": "9dee03b0648bdd40e984efbe666de7d2be14d926103c977c355e30501c7036f5", "stop": null}, "kind": "requirements", "prev":